cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Deferral Twin, please cite it as below."
title: "Deferral Twin: an honest digital twin"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sai Hardhik
    family-names: C
  - given-names: Gagan
    family-names: Chowdary
  - given-names: Charan
    family-names: Saatvikh
repository-code: "https://github.com/saihardhikreddy/deferral-twin"
abstract: >-
  A digital twin that answers in a person's own words, voice and face,
  using retrieval over their interview answers and a confidence gate
  that says "I don't know" when no evidence is close enough.
keywords:
  - digital twin
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - selective prediction
  - voice cloning
references:
  - type: dataset
    title: "Twin-2K-500"
    authors:
      - family-names: Toubia
        name-suffix: "et al."
    year: 2025
    url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/LLM-Digital-Twin/Twin-2K-500"
